{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0658"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge geography/countries","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/geography__countries.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",984],["+","Within Germany, Bavaria alone touches 3 foreign countries: the Czech Republic and Austria along its long eastern and southern frontiers and, across the waters of Lake Constance, Switzerland. Its other neighbours – Baden-Württemberg, Hesse, Thuringia and Saxony – are German states.\n\n"],["=",55],["+"," Russia's fourteen run from Norway and Finland in the far north-west through Estonia, Latvia, Belarus, Ukraine, Georgia, Azerbaijan, Kazakhstan, China, Mongolia and North Korea – and, thanks to the Kaliningrad exclave on the Baltic, Poland and Lithuania as well. China has as many neighbours, but none of them in Europe."]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",934],["+","Innerhalb Deutschlands berührt allein Bayern 3 ausländische Staaten: Tschechien und Österreich entlang seiner langen Ost- und Südgrenzen und, jenseits des Bodensees, die Schweiz. Seine übrigen Nachbarn – Baden-Württemberg, Hessen, Thüringen und Sachsen – sind deutsche Länder.\n\n"],["=",45],["+"," Russlands vierzehn reichen von Norwegen und Finnland im äußersten Nordwesten über Estland, Lettland, Belarus, die Ukraine, Georgien, Aserbaidschan, Kasachstan, China, die Mongolei und Nordkorea – und dank der Exklave Kaliningrad an der Ostsee auch bis Polen und Litauen. China hat ebenso viele Nachbarn, aber keinen davon in Europa."]]}]},
